    <h2 class="text-section-title">How Credit Scores Dictate Monthly Payments</h2>
    <p class="text-body section-body-prose">
      Mortgage pricing is structured around risk tiers known as Loan-Level Price Adjustments (LLPAs). Lenders assess interest rate surcharges based on your credit score bracket and down payment percentage. Even a modest credit score improvement can move you into a higher qualification bracket, translating directly to a lower interest rate.
    </p>

